d methodically inquiring into a situation or concept, making use of methods appropriate to the academic field or discipline."},{"language":"NL","value":"Kennis verwerven door het systematisch en methodisch bevragen van een situatie of concept waarbij gebruik gemaakt wordt van methoden die passen bij het vakgebied of de discipline."}],"levels":[{"code":"V","color":{"background":"#2bb14d"},"names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Contributes"},{"language":"NL","value":"Draagt bij aan"}]}],"reference":{"code":"01","id":"1","names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Researching"},{"language":"NL","value":"Onderzoeken"}],"subType":"skill","type":"skill"}},{"descriptions":[{"language":"EN","value":"Analysing situations or information and deciding what is of major and lesser importance. Seeing interrelationships and getting to the core of the matter."},{"language":"NL","value":"Ontleden van situaties of een hoeveelheid informatie in hoofd- en bijzaken. Zien van onderlinge verbanden en doordringen tot de kern."}],"levels":[{"code":"V","color":{"background":"#2bb14d"},"names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Contributes"},{"language":"NL","value":"Draagt bij aan"}]}],"reference":{"code":"02","id":"2","names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Analysing"},{"language":"NL","value":"Analyseren"}],"subType":"skill","type":"skill"}},{"descriptions":[{"language":"EN","value":"Setting out ideas and information clearly in writing, taking account of the relevant target group and in such a way that the message is received and understood."},{"language":"NL","value":"Ideeën en informatie helder op schrift stellen, rekening houdend met de doelgroep, en zodanig dat de boodschap overkomt en wordt begrepen."}],"levels":[{"code":"V","color":{"background":"#2bb14d"},"names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Contributes"},{"language":"NL","value":"Draagt bij aan"}]}],"reference":{"code":"08","id":"8","names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Written communication"},{"language":"NL","value":"Schriftelijk communiceren"}],"subType":"skill","type":"skill"}},{"descriptions":[{"language":"EN","value":"Critically evaluating own and others’ behaviour, viewpoints or methods, and being open to evaluation by others. Being able to learn from these evaluations by changing own behaviour, viewpoints or methods."},{"language":"NL","value":"Het kritisch evalueren van (eigen) gedrag, standpunten of methoden en open staan voor evaluatie door anderen. Het vermogen om te leren van deze evaluaties door wijziging van het eigen gedrag, standpunten of methoden."}],"levels":[{"code":"V","color":{"background":"#2bb14d"},"names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Contributes"},{"language":"NL","value":"Draagt bij aan"}]}],"reference":{"code":"11","id":"11","names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Reflecting"},{"language":"NL","value":"Reflecteren"}],"subType":"skill","type":"skill"}},{"descriptions":[{"language":"EN","value":"Self-directing own process of absorbing and applying new knowledge and information."},{"language":"NL","value":"Zelf sturing geven aan het eigen proces van nieuwe kennis en informatie opnemen en toepassen."}],"levels":[{"code":"V","color":{"background":"#2bb14d"},"names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Contributes"},{"language":"NL","value":"Draagt bij aan"}]}],"reference":{"code":"12","id":"12","names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Independent learning"},{"language":"NL","value":"Zelfstandig leren"}],"subType":"skill","type":"skill"}}],"terminated":false,"type":"DEFAULT","uid":"68316226-8145-404a-878c-26383846460c","values":[],"year":{"code":"2026-2027","id":"2261","names":[{"language":"EN","value":"2026-2027"},{"language":"NL","value":"2026-2027"}],"uid":"07254806-916f-4cca-82a0-2e69a4a95e9f"}},"englishName":"Introduction to Religious Studies","externalId":"270328","id":130985,"importDateTime":"2026-11-16T22:27:35.120725","localName":"Inleiding religiewetenschap","new":false,"productType":"MODULE","uid":"68316226-8145-404a-878c-26383846460c","year":{"active":true,"code":"2026-2027","endDate":"2027-08-31","englishName":"2